    "title": "Can Cleveland's young core step up when it matters most? The Guardians' depth is on trial - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Cleveland Baseball Talk Podcast, cleveland.com ,\n10 hours ago CLEVELAND, Ohio — For most of this season, the Cleveland Guardians have been a feel-good story. A young, deep, scrappy roster sitting on top of the AL Central despite modest expectations and even more modest offensive numbers. Their secret weapon? Depth. When one guy went cold, another got hot. When injuries happened — and they always happen — the next man up actually showed up. Read full article",
